  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Fountain of Life Church in Ilupeju is currently experiencing an internal leadership crisis involving Pastor Jimmy Odukoya. Recent developments include legal actions taken by Odukoya against his sister and seven other individuals, including church trustees, following his removal from the position of senior pastor. In response to the tension, security measures were tightened at the church premises, with reports noting the deployment of ten police vans and thorough searches of worshippers attending the service. During the event, Odukoya addressed the congregation and denied having received any formal court injunctions related to the dispute. Additionally, Bishop Okonkwo has publicly urged members of the church to refrain from taking sides in the matter, while some congregants have expressed their hope for an amicable resolution to the ongoing conflict within the church leadership.",
